Hmmm... I just had my first ascension after playing on and off since
1985.

I could never have done it without a lot of reading of spoilers.

Some important rules:

Be patient.

Save and walk away from the game a lot

Do not randomly use up items (scrolls and potions) without having ID'd
them

Price group everything

Do not wear or wield items without having B/U/C status them

Do not be afraid to run like a scared chicken

NEVER allow yourself to be burdened with hostiles nearby

Stay away from Thrones, Fountains and sinks till you can deal with
every bad outcome

Do not be afraid to use the E word. It is not really cheating. Many
creatures ignore it, and you are still vunerable from ranged attacks.

